                            <comment id="14062544" author="caniszczyk" created="Tue, 15 Jul 2014 19:41:45 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Spent some time last week setting up something very basic with middleman. I&apos;m not a designer so you&apos;re pretty much going to get a bootstrap site with minimal theming: &lt;a href=&quot;http://parquet.incubator.apache.org/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://parquet.incubator.apache.org/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We&apos;re going to need to update some of the markdown files to not mention the github site or point them to the new github mirror&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I put the documentation to update the site here: &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://parquet.incubator.apache.org/contribute/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://parquet.incubator.apache.org/contribute/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
